# ── Build output and deployment bundle ──────────────────────────────────────
# releases/ is assembled by build.ps1 and holds the compiled binary plus the
# REAL, filled-in configuration for whatever server it was built for. The
# committed folder_exporter.yml at the repo root is the example; the copy under
# releases/ is a live config and must never be committed.
